classDiagram
    direction LR
    class CVE {
        +string cve_id
        +string summary
        +float cvss_score
    }
    class Strategy {
        +string session_id
        +string content
        +string reasoning_chain
    }
    class Ranking {
        +string user_id
        +timestamp created_at
        +list order
    }

    CVE "1" --> "*" Strategy : 生成 (Generates)
    Strategy "1" --> "*" Ranking : 被评价 (Has Rankings)